# Never commit anything captured from a live controller.
# Snapshots contain cleartext WPA passphrases, device SSH passwords, IPS utm_token,
# and per-device x_authkey. See skills/capturing-a-unifi-baseline/SKILL.md.
*/raw/
**/raw/
*.unf
baseline/
unifi-baseline-*/
unifi-rf-samples-*.txt

# Key material
*.key
.unifi_key
*_key
*.pem

.DS_Store
